WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:10.360
Every day, the tortoise took a walk around the lake.

2
00:00:10.361 --> 00:00:13.384
He enjoyed walking very much.

3
00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:17.600
While walking one day, the tortoise heard a sound like the wind.

4
00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:25.859
A hare rushed by and the tortoise fell over on his back.

5
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.314
"Ha-ha! What are you doing here?" teased the hare.

6
00:00:30.315 --> 00:00:38.432
"You should be careful of others on the road," scolded the tortoise.

7
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:43.778
"Slowpokes shouldn't be on the road," said the hare.

8
00:00:43.779 --> 00:00:45.836
A fox walked by.

9
00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:48.261
He helped the tortoise turn over.

10
00:00:48.262 --> 00:00:53.088
"What are you two talking about?" asked the fox.

11
00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:56.686
"I think that slow walkers shouldn't use the road.

12
00:00:56.687 --> 00:01:00.271
Don't you agree, Fox?" asked the hare.

13
00:01:00.272 --> 00:01:05.354
"The road is for everyone," said the fox.

14
00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:09.166
"I'll tell you what," challenged the hare.

15
00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.837
"Let's have a race.

16
00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:18.021
The winner decides who can stay on the road and who can't."

17
00:01:18.022 --> 00:01:27.020
"You're on," agreed the tortoise. "Let's race!"

18
00:01:27.021 --> 00:01:30.712
They decided to race to the other side of the forest.

19
00:01:30.713 --> 00:01:33.950
The fox agreed to be the judge.

20
00:01:33.951 --> 00:01:39.162
The next day, all of the animals gathered in a crowd to watch.

21
00:01:39.163 --> 00:01:44.529
"It's not too late to stop the race," whispered the hare to the tortoise.

22
00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:48.224
"It's obvious who is going to win."

23
00:01:48.225 --> 00:01:54.676
"On your mark, get set, go!" yelled the fox.

24
00:01:54.677 --> 00:01:56.962
The hare ran ahead of the tortoise.

25
00:01:56.963 --> 00:01:58.552
Then he ran back.

26
00:01:58.553 --> 00:02:01.237
"Are you still here?" he teased.

27
00:02:01.238 --> 00:02:09.694
"This is going to take forever," he sighed.

28
00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:15.290
After running for a little while, the hare looked back but could not see the tortoise.

29
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:17.980
So he stopped and looked around.

30
00:02:17.981 --> 00:02:20.976
He noticed some carrots beside the road.

31
00:02:20.977 --> 00:02:26.001
"Oh, my favorite!" said the hare.

32
00:02:26.002 --> 00:02:29.644
The tortoise kept his eyes on the path ahead.

33
00:02:29.645 --> 00:02:50.071
"Come on, Tortoise! You can do it!" encouraged the other animals.

34
00:02:50.072 --> 00:02:53.202
The hare ate a lot of carrots.

35
00:02:53.203 --> 00:02:57.182
"Oh, I'm so full," he groaned.

36
00:02:57.183 --> 00:03:00.981
"I'm just going to take a little nap.

37
00:03:00.982 --> 00:03:05.471
The tortoise is still way behind me."

38
00:03:05.472 --> 00:03:08.937
Meanwhile the tortoise kept walking steadily.

39
00:03:08.938 --> 00:03:13.522
He never gave up. He never stopped.

40
00:03:13.523 --> 00:03:16.880
Sometime later, the hare awoke from his nap.

41
00:03:16.881 --> 00:03:19.787
He thought he was still far ahead.

42
00:03:19.788 --> 00:03:24.242
He began to skip, trot, jump, and dance.

43
00:03:24.243 --> 00:03:29.480
When he got close to the finish line, he couldn't believe his eyes!

44
00:03:29.481 --> 00:03:32.220
The tortoise was far ahead!

45
00:03:32.221 --> 00:03:35.845
"That's impossible!" cried the hare.

46
00:03:35.846 --> 00:03:40.683
He ran as fast as he could, but he couldn't catch up.

47
00:03:40.684 --> 00:03:43.364
The tortoise crossed the finish line.

48
00:03:43.365 --> 00:03:48.863
He won the race!

49
00:03:48.864 --> 00:03:51.567
The tortoise looked at the hare.

50
00:03:51.568 --> 00:03:59.708
"Slow but steady wins the race," he said.
